## Context

Child of 0700. Closing the collection: the pool is frozen when all routes of the
protocol are executed or declared impossible, and the whole pool is screened.
This ticket carries the freeze deliverables.

Interim freeze possible before closing: the `icf_screen` table (1655) is
append-only; the screen of the existing stock stays valid, only additions are
screened. The diagram counts are fixed only at the final freeze.

Pieces already in draft (branch of ticket 1530): provisional structure and
figures of the diagram in `conception/rel-prisma-flux-provisoire.md`, annex
`conception/rel-sud-et-langues-annexe-brouillon.md`, Astra's review note.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Protocol updated and reconciled with the `origin/main` version: three-stage screen, sentinels fixed, two chaining rounds, non-OpenAlex sources, reserves, BRICS rule
- [ ] PRISMA diagram: counts rebuilt by script from the registries and the `icf_screen` table, identification by source and by date (PRISMA-S)
- [ ] Automation declared: models, versions, prompts, agreements measured with the reference judge
- [ ] Method paragraph written with the final counts
- [ ] Freeze manifest: file hashes, code SHA, DVC lock, model and prompt versions
- [ ] Reproduction package: configurations, code, registries and outputs of each pass, prompts (including stage 2), sentinels, advisor outputs
- [ ] Reserve sentinels reported apart from tuning ones

## Raid checkpoint — 1656 — Phase 2 Imagine

Freeze the post-chaining corpus with one inventory-driven script and one DVC package. Preserve accepted limitations rather than reopen prior decisions. Reuse pool/view/QA, archive actual external production history, and derive counts from authoritative registries/tables. Do not regenerate pinned catalogue or duplicate facet logic. Records, works and observed families are distinct units.


## Raid checkpoint — 1656 — Phase 3 Actions and first test

1. Require1654 completion. Add fixed config/rel_freeze_inventory.yaml enumerating logical artifacts/root/path/provenance/required status. Collect exact production artifacts, never whole home directories or credentials.
2. Add scripts/corpus_rel_freeze.py to validate inventory/nested manifests, package artifacts, record hashes/codeSHA/DVC lock and pointers/models/prompts, generate source/query/date PRISMA counts and reconciliation reports. Reject missing required evidence/corruption; refuse dirty source checkout as frozen code identity.
3. Disposition549 unresolved DOI version hints and1156 unmatched label rows (baseline818 titled+277 title-less historical works): explicit matching, safely migrated append-only labels where warranted, unresolved/ambiguous/absent explanations. Do not silently add unmatched historical works or fuzzy-transfer labels. Record first dissemination/publication-version evidence and observed-family limits.
4. Keep REL pin unified_works_rel_pin.csv,43179rows,md5 3633ad9f4517c02618a0ecab722a8051. Explain separately current dvc.lock's distinct catalogue output; archive both contracts without regenerating pin/rewriting unrelated outputs.
5. Set final rel_review.search_date from latest completed identification query/retrieval including chaining/non-OA routes; preserve per-source dates, distinguish freeze/screen timestamps. Report complete1990–2025 research versus partial2026/full-date quarantine, institutional documents and other types separately.
6. Generate identification/dedup/screening/reason counts using merge report and final view at consistent units. Distinguish fully graded research/synthesis, bibliometric designation and pending inventories; check partition sums. Archive actual heterogeneous models/versions/routes/prompt hashes, agreements at their true pre/postcorrection revisions; final sample audit waived, not passed.
7. Update protocol against origin/main, final PRISMA, method paragraph, sensitivity/reconstruction note, BRICS coverage and source gaps. Reserve/tuning sentinels separately; disclose tuning-driven gap-fill contamination. Preserve1790 author nonblocker,296stage2+59title-less accepted residues, no-abstract policy; baseline5894 pending is remeasured after chaining. Discipline exclusions carry over-exclusion risk, not proven numerical upper bound.
8. DVC-add/push one dated data/rel_freeze package. In separate clean populated padme checkout restore recorded code/data and run make data, make rel-pool-data, make rel-pool, make rel-venues, make rel-view plus freeze counts. Require byte-identical deterministic outputs on repeated rebuild. Keep manifest timestamp envelope separate; fresh API/model responses are historical-execution evidence, not byte-reproducibility promise. Run required gates, review/merge.

Required archive roots (presence checked):
- ~/rel_pool_runs, especially2026-10-07-code-snapshot:65immediatefiles=63payloads+README.txt+MANIFEST.sha256;50.pyfiles. Preserve exact manifest/map, call them63actual-run/audit files, not63Python scripts.
- ~/data/projets/climate-finance-het/rel_sud/2026-09-29 with adhoc-scripts, advisor-reports, padme-rel_sud_runs.
