- Repository configs/prompts/sentinels/code/lock, data/rel_intake, pin, rel_screen, rel_venues, deterministic outputs, dated venue registries and1654archive.
Presence is not integrity: execution must verify required content/hashes.

First red test: synthetic overlapping sources with two query dates, one work in both, working-paper/article family, institutional item, year-only2026item. Assert distinct records/works/families, proper research exclusion/quarantine and cutoff based on completed identification, not freeze timestamp. Mutated packaged file and missing required production snapshot must fail verification by named path.

Verified helpers: corpus_rel_view.run(pool_path,table_path,out_dir,window_cfg,rule,*,dims_path,venues_path,seriousness_rule,membership); pipeline_loaders.classify_rel_review_works(works,config=None); pool/report builders and make rel-pool-data restore exact frozen pin without catalogue regeneration. Use pathlib/shutil/hashlib/CSV/JSON/YAML+DVC; no archive framework/service.

